Notebook Design Principles
One claim per notebook (or tight claim cluster) — traceable from claim → metrics → entities → sources → extraction log
Evidence-first — every visual element cites Source IDs and confidence levels
Interactive — Plotly/Altair for hover, filter, drill-down; ipywidgets for parameter exploration
Reproducible — notebook reads directly from data/smarthome.duckdb (read-only) via DuckDB
Provenance panel — sidebar or collapsible section showing: Claim ID, Claim text, Claim type, Confidence, Source IDs, Falsifier, Extraction log refs
Uncertainty visible — confidence bands, "conditions not stated" flags, conflicting values shown side-by-side (e.g., M101 vs M102 heat pump override rates)
