Technical Architecture
Shared Library (src/viz_core.py)
# Core utilities used by all notebooks
- connect_db(read_only=True) -> duckdb.Connection
- fetch_claim(claim_id) -> dict
- fetch_metrics_for_claim(claim_id) -> pd.DataFrame
- fetch_entities_for_claim(claim_id) -> pd.DataFrame
- fetch_sources_for_claim(claim_id) -> pd.DataFrame
- fetch_predicates_for_entities(entity_ids) -> pd.DataFrame
- fetch_extraction_log_for_claim(claim_id) -> pd.DataFrame
- render_provenance_panel(claim_id) -> ipywidgets/HTML
- confidence_color(confidence) -> str
- evidence_class_marker(claim_type) -> str
Notebook Template
# Claim: {Claim Text} [{Claim ID}]

## Provenance Panel (collapsible)
- Claim ID, Type, Confidence, Falsifier
- Source IDs with links
- Extraction Log entries
- Workflow Stage

## Visualization 1: {Primary evidence}
[Interactive plot with hover showing source, confidence, conditions]

## Visualization 2: {Supporting context}
[Related entities, predicates, or comparative metrics]

## Uncertainty & Gaps
- Conditions not stated
- Conflicting values
- Missing falsifiers
- Open questions

## Reproducibility
- DuckDB query used
- Notebook parameters (if any)
